@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api

### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "J@hnD0e1",
  "document": "12345678901"
}


### Find all User
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Find by Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/91486ee9-e4e2-47c3-b9a6-61e72f7845d1

### Delete by Id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/c22c7ed7-d957-4edb-896c-822bc80c3fae


### Update user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/c22c7ed7-d957-4edb-896c-822bc80c3fae
Content-Type: application/json

